  "details": "Normally [Safety mode] would be okay EXCEPT the new update sets everything in custom to off thus taking time to set it back to what you had before. On Desktop where you use \"Shift\" to run, if you open your menu while running, you accidently block everyone. If there was a setting to disable this, it wouldn't happen. In VR, while using the oculus, if I'm holding stuff in both hands and I use both menu buttons to reset playspace mover then I'm forced into safety mode as well.",
